					台詞 = 「Welcome %CALLNAME:MASTER%-san.」
					IF GET_DAY() == "日" || GET_DAY() == "土"
						台詞 = %台詞%/「Do you have the day off? Don't do this too often.」
					ELSE
						台詞 = %台詞%/「Did work tire you out today? Make sure to relax.」
					ENDIF
					台詞 = %台詞%/「Please accept this gift of 150 Charisma from Ojousama.」
					表情 = 通常
					MONEY:2 += 150
				CASE "Marisa"
					;図書館がらみで出禁くらっててもおかしくないよね
					台詞 = 「Oh, it's %CALLNAME:MASTER%-san.」 /「Here, take these 100 Charisma.」 /「It's a gift we give to all new Customers first time they show up.」 /「Nevertheless, you are not welcomed by Ojousama.」 /「Please be on your best behavior in the casino and enjoy yourself.」
